    ℝ/ℂ as content, no posited group/cover/surjectivity, no bridge.
  • COMPLETE — all decls foundations-only `{propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound}` (audited).
  • PHYSICS-WORDS-REMOVABLE — delete Lorentz/reflection/cover/spinor/Clifford/Pin/Minkowski/
    isometry/surjectivity/unit-normalized: the statement stands as pure algebra over the derived
    field `Cut` — every `BvC`-isometry of `STVC` is the covered operator of an element of the
    submonoid `PinUnitSub` (generated by the unit-axis Clifford units), via the scale-invariance
